ions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/6384588082/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/6423247870","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/3942#issuecomment-6423247870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/3942","id":6423247870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABftr7_g","user":{"login":"Niko1221","id":86886444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODg2NDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86886444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:46:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:46:12Z","body":"Thanks for the detailed first run. The RAM store stopping near 48 GB was a limit in the 0.2.4 engine: since 0.2.5 the automatic store can take all routed experts when free RAM holds them, and 0.2.6 copies them into RAM at load when they fit, so your 128 GB machine should now hold the full 2.00-bit set. Please update and rerun r1; the start log says how big the store is and whether experts are copied in. With the store full we expect decode well above your 8-10 tok/s, but we have not measured a 24 GB card with 128 GB, so please post what you see. About TTFT: the first request after start reads cold Engram rows and experts from disk, so later requests should start faster.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/6423247870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/6450081755","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/3942#issuecomment-6450081755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/3942","id":6450081755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABgHRv2w","user":{"login":"tha80","id":7176001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzYwMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7176001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80","html_url":"https://github.com/tha80","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tha80/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:16:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T18:16:47Z","body":"My machine has 64GB RAM and a 3090 with 24GB VRAM and I running IST-DAS-2.00bpw configured with 262144 context size and vision enabled.\n\nWith the very first ds41 compatible release (0.2.4?) I archived about 9 to 13 token/s on my setup. But since then, with 0.2.5 and 0.2.6 I only archive about 4-6 token/s. And it seems to be caused by the RAM usage with the newer versions is only at about 23-25GB (less than 50%). With the old version it was using about double that (46-50GB). And because less RAM is used the SSD needs to transfer more data, which my SSD at least can't provide and therefore the performance halfed.\n\nEven when my setup is different from the reporter, I think it's the same problem I have. Please let me know if you need more infos.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/6450081755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]